  "notes": "List prices taken from the public checkout catalog API (regularPrice, identical across MT5/TradeLocker/Match-Trader) and the futures pricing cards; site-wide promo SPOOKY (45% off CFD, capped at 40% on futures, 25% on Atlas Daily) and first-purchase code NEW (50% off) shown on homepage. Access: $5 entry for every size, then a funded fee only if you pass (5K $52 ... 400K $1,739) — recorded as funded_fee_on_pass. 1-Step Daily / 2-Step Daily (replaced Pro programs 26 Oct 2026) exist in the help centre with sizes $5K-$200K but their prices were not exposed in the catalog/pricing widget, so sizes_fees is empty. Catalog also lists a hidden '3 Step' product ($34-$591) not presented on the site; omitted. fee_from=43 (2-Step $5K); Access entry is $5. Headline rules = 1-Step (homepage default). Funded accounts: news ±5 min profit deducted, trades <3 min profit deducted, Atlas Protector (2% net floating loss closes all; split drops to 50%; 2nd trigger breach). Futures: positions flattened 4:45 PM ET, no overnight. Leverage 1:100 from rules API. HQ: operating entity Atlas Vanquish FZCO, Dubai Silicon Oasis; registered entity Atlas Funded LTD, Saint Lucia; offices also in England. Terms say MT5 services not for US citizens/residents; no full restricted-country list published. Homepage marketing mentions 'predictions and crypto' but no crypto product/instrument list found (forex FAQ lists FX, metals, energy, index CFDs only) — no crypto file. Max allocation total not published.",
